      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Wow finally I dug out this canny.\n\nHere is the information. \n\nhttps://vrclibrary.com/wiki/books/stubthe-vrcdocs-complementation-project/page/vrc-station\n\nUsing \"Immobilize For Vehicle\" with \"Seated: false\" will cause the pinned-down bug to a player.\n\n・Someone exits the station, she/he cannot move by the stick.\n\nー・There are some walkarounds:\n\nーー・Use the \"Seated: true\" station to fix the bug.\n\nーーー・(I think it will cause the other bugs by fast enter-exit on the station.)\n\nーー・Use the station with the animator. If TrackingControl sets true to all, the pinned-down bug will removed completely, on SDK3.\n\nーーー・Another problem, there is no TrackingControl on worldSDK. Canny is here.",
